extends layout

block content
  section.section
    .container
      h1.page-title About OutfitShare
      p.page-subtitle Our mission is to make fashion sustainable, affordable, and community-driven.

      .about-content
        .about-section
          h2 Our Story
          p OutfitShare was born from a simple observation: most of us have outfits in our wardrobes that we've worn only once or twice — for a job interview, a wedding, a special occasion. Meanwhile, someone nearby might be searching for exactly that outfit and unable to afford buying new.
          p We created OutfitShare to bridge that gap. Our platform connects people within local communities, enabling them to lend, borrow, and give away clothing in a structured, trust-based system. By sharing rather than buying, we reduce fashion waste, lower costs, and build stronger communities.

        .about-section
          h2 What We Do
          .about-grid
            .about-card
              .about-card-icon 👗
              h3 Share Outfits
              p Lend your clothing to neighbours, classmates, and community members. Earn reward points for every successful transaction.
            .about-card
              .about-card-icon 🔄
              h3 Borrow with Ease
              p Find the perfect outfit for any occasion without buying new. Our smart filters help you discover items that match your size and style.
            .about-card
              .about-card-icon 🎁
              h3 Give Away
              p Declutter responsibly by listing items as giveaways. Earn sustainability points and help someone find their next favourite piece.
            .about-card
              .about-card-icon ⭐
              h3 Build Trust
              p Our dual rating system, reviews, and verified profiles create a safe environment where sharing thrives.

        .about-section
          h2 Our Values
          .values-list
            .value-item
              h3 Sustainability
              p We believe the most sustainable garment is the one that already exists. Every outfit shared is one less produced.
            .value-item
              h3 Community
              p Fashion shouldn't be isolating. OutfitShare creates connections between people who share more than just clothes.
            .value-item
              h3 Affordability
              p Looking your best shouldn't break the bank. We make fashion accessible to everyone through sharing.
            .value-item
              h3 Trust & Safety
              p Separate borrow and lend ratings, admin moderation, and transparent reviews ensure a safe platform for all users.

        .about-section
          h2 The Team
          p OutfitShare is developed by TriCode Labs, a student team at the University of Roehampton, London. Built as part of the Software Engineering module (CMP-N204-0), the platform demonstrates how technology can address real-world challenges around waste, affordability, and community building.
